       "text": "-\"Mana\" corrected to \"Faith\" in shops",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Found Treasures now display their Treasure Number",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Post credits score tally sequence added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Balancing to boss weaknesses",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-\"Chicken\" password is harder, and has swarms now",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
